        "title": "Approximate the square roots",
        "body": "$\\sqrt{24}\\approx\\sqrt{25}=5$ (in fact $4{,}9$), so $\\sqrt{24}-1\\approx4$ (in fact $3{,}9$), its square root is about $2$ (in fact $1{,}97$) and the fraction is about $\\frac32=1{,}5$ (in fact $1{,}52$).\n\n**Answer: (A) 1,5**"
      }
