      {
        "title": "Compare as powers of 3",
        "body": "(A) $333$ is less than $3^6=729$. (B) $33^3<(3^4)^3=3^{12}$ is much smaller than $3^{27}$. (C) $(3^3)^3=3^9$. (D) $3^{(3^3)}=3^{27}$. (E) $3^{33}$. Since $3^{33}>3^{27}>3^9$ and the others are smaller still ($33^3=35\\,937<3^{10}$), (E) is the largest.\n\n**Answer: (E)**"
