    "prompt": "A cube is inscribed in a sphere of diameter $9\\sqrt3$ cm. The volume of the cube in cm$^3$ is",
    "image": null,
    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "243"
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "729"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "$243\\sqrt3$"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "$9\\sqrt3$"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "27"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Space diagonal",
        "body": "The space diagonal of the cube is the diameter of the sphere. For side $s$ the space diagonal is $s\\sqrt3$ (Pythagoras twice: $d^2=2s^2$, $d^2+s^2=3s^2$). So $s\\sqrt3=9\\sqrt3$, $s=9$ and the volume is $9^3=729$.\n\n**Answer: (B) 729**"
      }
    ],
    "topics": [
