    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Venn diagram",
        "body": "Let $x$ be the number speaking only English. All three: 5. Sotho and English only: $9-5=4$. Sotho and Afrikaans only: $12-5=7$. Only Sotho: 0. English and Afrikaans only: $18-5-4-x=9-x$. Afrikaans only: $20-7-5-(9-x)=x-1$. Everyone speaks at least one language (30 people), so\n$$0+7+4+5+(x-1)+(9-x)+x=24+x=30,$$\nand $x=6$.\n\n**Answer: (B) 6**"
