        "body": "If $u=0$: $v+w+x+y+z=3$ has $\\binom{3+4}{4}=35$ solutions (stars and bars). If $u=1$: $v+w+x+y+z=1$ has $5$ solutions. $u\\ge2$ is impossible. Total $35+5=40$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 40**"
